{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265LvVQHHflQ1794380183.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西寶城分行分區營業經理胡煥燁表示，旗下高級客戶經理林鎂欣新近促成貝沙灣租賃成交，單位為6期7座低層A室，實用面積1,042平方呎，採3房1套間隔，向西，享池海雙景，景觀開揚，最新連車位以6.1萬元租出，折合實用呎租58.5元。<br/>林鎂欣表示，新租客為專才，心儀單位海景，且貝沙灣自成一角，環境清幽舒適，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2007年以1,573萬元購入單位，持貨19年，是次出租可享約4.7厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:59.324026+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.428044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:37:15.461142+00:00","content_hash":"71fbd90c3b140236825d913de118e24731c1a54c5f5748ba2fe8c322b576a91b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:59.324026+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}